{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/onydsbmd","slide":2,"name":"problem-title","text":"A goal is easy.\nA defended goal is not.","textPreview":"A goal is easy. | A defended goal is not.","textChars":39,"textLines":2,"bbox":[285.01,139.99,899.98,141.96]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9o7ulg3y","slide":2,"text":"Agents can take a task. Long-horizon work adds resistance: mistakes compound before the finish.","textPreview":"Agents can take a task. Long-horizon work adds resistance: mistakes compound before the finish.","textChars":95,"textLines":1,"bbox":[285.01,312,779.98,91.96]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a9gvulkj","slide":2,"name":"primary-problem-metric","text":"1st","textPreview":"1st","textChars":3,"textLines":1,"bbox":[285.01,451.99,259.96,95.96]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ba9cn6l4","slide":2,"text":"ATTEMPT\nEven strong players need a coach.","textPreview":"ATTEMPT | Even strong players need a coach.","textChars":41,"textLines":2,"bbox":[569.99,466.02,559.97,69.96]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/wbidwb29","slide":2,"name":"accent-rule","bbox":[285.01,580.01,854.97,1.97]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xcrupg3u","slide":2,"text":"The question is not whether an agent can try. It is how the agent improves.","textPreview":"The question is not whether an agent can try. It is how the agent improves.","textChars":75,"textLines":1,"bbox":[285.01,595.01,849.98,29.97]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slide":2,"text":"0:12–0:48 — Quick question: who watched the World Cup this summer? Raise your hand. If you didn’t, are you at least familiar with soccer—or fútbol? Great. Give anyone here a ball and an empty goal, and I hope we can score. Put Argentina’s World Cup team in defense, and unless you’re Lamine Yamal, probably not on the first try. Long-horizon agent tasks work the same way: the goal is clear, but the path is defended by compounding mistakes.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/worldcup/canadamexicousa2026/articles/spain-argentina-final-report-highlights\n[/Sources]"}
