{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slide":7,"text":"2:18–2:34 — The task only wins when every required check and the fresh final audit pass. A confident answer cannot waive failed evidence. Goalie keeps retrying within explicit time, turn, cost, and plateau limits.\n\n[Sources]\n- README.md\n- docs/architecture.md\n[/Sources]"}
