{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e1kfu9sj","slide":8,"text":"Coached recovery","textPreview":"Coached recovery","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[180.02,386,359.96,37.95]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f2tg3e94","slide":8,"text":"Each miss becomes focused context for the next attempt.","textPreview":"Each miss becomes focused context for the next attempt.","textChars":55,"textLines":1,"bbox":[569.99,390.01,589.95,53.97]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/03mhwjap","slide":8,"name":"reason-rule-2","bbox":[63.99,468.02,1095.95,0.94]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14vy5ora","slide":8,"text":"03","textPreview":"03","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[63.99,510.01,79.97,29.97]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u50fi5sf","slide":8,"text":"Durable progress","textPreview":"Durable progress","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[180.02,506,359.96,37.95]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/v69gra90","slide":8,"text":"Evidence, checkpoints, and fresh audits preserve what was learned.","textPreview":"Evidence, checkpoints, and fresh audits preserve what was learned.","textChars":66,"textLines":1,"bbox":[569.99,510.01,589.95,53.97]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/xkfix8bi","slide":8,"name":"reason-rule-3","bbox":[63.99,588.02,1095.95,0.94]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fu1gfa1s","slide":8,"text":"2:34–2:53 — So why does the goalie keep blocking the model? Because failure is fuel. Argentina lost to Saudi Arabia in its first 2022 World Cup match, learned, recovered, and became champion. Humans use failure to get better. Agents should too.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://www.fifa.com/es/articles/el-camino-de-argentina-hacia-el-titulo-de-la-copa-mundial\n[/Sources]"}
