{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/udsvah03","slide":9,"text":"2:53–3:00 — People say, ‘Failure is not an option.’ For the agentic future, I believe failure is the only option—because it is how the next attempt becomes better. Thank you. Find Goalie on GitHub; I need stars.\n\n[Sources]\n- User-provided presentation script\n[/Sources]"}